<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables -.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables -.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Monday that Hilton Hotels Corp, Hilton preferred P stock, ITT Corp and Rayonier Inc were not available for after-hours trading. </p>
<p>Hilton announced earlier it had offered to acquire ITT for more than $10 billion, including debt.</p>
<p>Meanwhile, Rayonier reported a fourth-quarter loss of $5.36 a share after charges against a year-ago profit of $1.13.</p>
<p>The exchange said those stocks were not available for news.</p>
<p>It said Corimon SACA, Westmoreland Coal Co, Westmoreland preferred A stock and Mid-American Waste Systems were also unavailable.</p>
